  data: {
    LLM: "Player to dealer's right leads. Must follow suit if possible. First time a player cannot follow suit and plays another suit, that suit becomes trumps for the hand. Once trumps are set, must follow suit or play a trump; may play a lower trump only when void in the led suit. Trick winner leads to the next trick. Card points: Ace 11, King 4, Ober 3, Under 2, Banner 10, 9/8/7/6 zero; in trump Under 20, 9 14. Last trick bonus 5; total 157 points.",
    Player: "Player to dealer's right leads. Must follow suit if possible. First time a player cannot follow suit and plays another suit, that suit becomes trumps for the hand. Once trumps are set, must follow suit or play a trump; may play a lower trump only when void in the led suit. Trick winner leads to the next trick. Card points: Ace 11, King 4, Ober 3, Under 2, Banner 10, 9/8/7/6 zero; in trump Under 20, 9 14. Last trick bonus 5; total 157 points.",
    objective: 'Be the first to score 7 sticks. Score sticks by having the highest or lowest card-point total when everyone is under 100 points, or by having the only different total when others tie; if someone takes 100 or more, only the player with least points scores.',
    gameplay: "Player to dealer's right leads. Must follow suit if possible. First time a player cannot follow suit and plays another suit, that suit becomes trumps for the hand. Once trumps are set, must follow suit or play a trump; may play a lower trump only when void in the led suit. Trick winner leads to the next trick. Card points: Ace 11, King 4, Ober 3, Under 2, Banner 10, 9/8/7/6 zero; in trump Under 20, 9 14. Last trick bonus 5; total 157 points.",
    keyRules: [
      'First void play sets trumps for the hand',
      'Sticks only; no potatoes',
      'First to 7 sticks wins',
      'Under 100: most and least card points score one stick each',
      '100 or more: only least points scores one stick',
      'Puur (Under of trumps) need not be played when trumps led and it is your only trump',
