    turnFlow: "Player to dealer's right leads. Must follow suit if possible. First time a player cannot follow suit and plays another suit, that suit becomes trumps for the hand. Once trumps are set, must follow suit or play a trump; may play a lower trump only when void in the led suit. Trick winner leads to the next trick. Card points: Ace 11, King 4, Ober 3, Under 2, Banner 10, 9/8/7/6 zero; in trump Under 20, 9 14. Last trick bonus 5; total 157 points.",
